hadiths[23]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1264","Rabi'a ibn 'Abdullah ibn al-Hadir ibn 'Abdullah reported tht two\nmen wagered two cocks in the time of 'Umar. 'Umar ordered that the cock\nbe killed and a man of the Ansar said to him"
"1265","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"1266","Husayn ibn Mus'ab reported that someone told Abu Hurayra"
"1267","It is related tht al-Bara' ibn Malik used to do the camel-chant\nfor the men and Anjasha used to do the camel-chant for the women. He had\na good voice and the Prophet"
"1268","Ibn 'Abbas said that the words of Allah in Luqman (35:6)"
"1269","Al-Bara' ibn 'Azib reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"1270","Salman al-Ilhani reported that Fadala ibn 'Ubayd was in a gathering.\nHe heard that some people were playing backgammon. He got up in anger and\nforbade it in the strongest possible terms. Then he said"
"1271","Al-Fadil ibn Muslim reported that his father said"
"1272","Abu Musa al-Ash'ari reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"1273","'Abdullah ibn Mas'ud said"
"1274","Burayda reported that the Prophet"
"1275","Abu Musa reported that the Prophet"
"1276","Nafi' related that if 'Abdullah ibn 'Umar found any of his family\nplaying backgammon"
"1277","'Alqama ibn Abi 'Alqama reported from his mother that 'A'isha"
"1278","Kulthum ibn Jabir said"
"1279","Ya'la ibn Murra reported that he heard Abu Hurayra speaking about\nsomeone who plays backgammon and bets on it"
"1280","'Abdullah ibn 'Amr ibn al-'As said"
"1281","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"1282","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"1283","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"1284","Same hadith as 1280"
"1285","Abu'l-Malih reported from one of his people (who was a Companion)\nthat the Prophet"
"1286","Muhammad ibn Sirin related that Abu Hurayra blew his nose in his\ngarment and then said"
